; 99 strokes
; chain order: nearest-safe (min separation = half each chain's own wiggle lead-in, 10.00mm) -- keeps consecutive laser-off/on events apart enough to avoid residual-heat bias, without a farthest-first travel penalty
; power mode: M3 (static); strokes simplified 0.05mm, min segment 0.3mm
; warmup: linear model, 600ms = 20.00mm at F2000 (60.0% of the 1000ms full-power ramp) -- closed loops follow through past the start (laps until warm), open strokes ping-pong over themselves first
; strokes SMOOTHED: spline within 0.08mm of the trace + tangent biarcs within 0.02mm (max shape change 0.1mm, quickcut/arcfit.py)
